  "details": "In VRChat, I am making an OSC program that records /usercamera/Pose data and plays it back in order to recieve somewhat a replay system. The problem is however, camera pose uses the flying feature in order to set the position, which is a problem because then I can't move when it happens. I'm wondering if it could be possible to have a new way in the camera to set position and rotation without using a feature that messes with player input\n\nhttps://i.guns.lol/ymTLC (Video attached of program)",
